font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#333333\">Sanat ve Mesleki Eğitim At&ouml;lyelerimiz</span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#333333\">Sanat ve Mesleki Eğitim At&ouml;lyelerimiz ile gen&ccedil;lerimizin yeteneklerini geliştirmesini sağlıyoruz.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#333333\">Kadın Spor Salonu</span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#333333\">En yeni aletlerle donattığımız Kadın Spor Salonumuz, mahallemizde bu tesisten faydalanmak isteyen komşularımıza hizmet veriyor.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#333333\">K&uuml;t&uuml;phane</span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#333333\">&Ccedil;eşitli kategorilerdeki kitaplarla dolu k&uuml;t&uuml;phanelerimiz, okuyucularını bekliyor. K&uuml;t&uuml;phanemiz aynı zamanda sınavlarına hazırlanmak isteyen gen&ccedil;lerimize uygun bir ortam oluşturuyor.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#333333\">Derslikler</span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#333333\">Kursiyerlerimiz, dersliklerimizde ilgi duydukları alanlarda eğitim alıyor.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#333333\">Taziye Salonlarımız</span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#333333\">Kadın ve erkek taziye salonlarımızı komşularımızın hizmetine tahsis ettik.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#333333\">Kafede Kitap</span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#333333\">Gen&ccedil;lerimizin hem kitap okuyabilecekleri, hem de keyifli sohbetler yapabilecekleri Kafede Kitap&rsquo;ı hizmete sunduk.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#333333\">Tesisimizde ayrıca bay ve bayan mescitler de bulunuyor.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />\r\n&nbsp;","startDate":"0000-00-00","endDate":"0000-00-00","createdAt":"2024-02-20T05:06:09+03:00","updatedAt":"2026-01-29T10:44:27+03:00"},{"id":17,"title":"MALKOÇOĞLU MAHALLESİ KAPALI PAZAR,AİLE SAĞLIĞI MERKEZİ VE YEŞİL ALAN","description":"","startDate":"0000-00-00","endDate":"0000-00-00","createdAt":"2024-02-20T04:00:01+03:00","updatedAt":"2025-12-01T16:40:59+03:00"},{"id":15,"title":"CEMİL MERİÇ KÜLTÜR VE YAŞAM  MERKEZİ","description":"50. Yıl Mahallesi&#39;nde hizmete sunduğumuz Cemil Meri&ccedil; K&uuml;lt&uuml;r Merkezimiz i&ccedil;erisinde bir&ccedil;ok fonksiyonu barındırıyor.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:C